WEBVTT

00:03:27.462 --> 00:03:30.208
"Do you often think
about the man who raped you?"

00:03:30.232 --> 00:03:34.196
And she said, "I used to think
about him with anger,

00:03:34.908 --> 00:03:36.593
but now only with pity."

00:03:37.387 --> 00:03:40.020
And I thought she meant pity
because he was so unevolved

00:03:40.044 --> 00:03:42.120
as to have done this terrible thing.

00:03:42.576 --> 00:03:43.866
And I said, "Pity?"

00:03:44.343 --> 00:03:45.927
And she said, "Yes,

00:03:46.033 --> 00:03:51.068
because he has a beautiful daughter
and two beautiful grandchildren,

00:03:51.092 --> 00:03:52.566
and he doesn't know that,

00:03:53.063 --> 00:03:54.281
and I do.

00:03:54.820 --> 00:03:56.120
So as it turns out,

00:03:56.669 --> 00:03:58.140
I'm the lucky one."